decs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/8f31518067a324f62fbd7332dfe1077e.mp4?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE LANDSCAPES</strong></h2>Wander through a procedural world inspired by unique landscapes. Battle dozens of deadly folkloric creatures in a fast-paced combat system where any mistake is fatal. Unravel new secrets every time you enter the jungle. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/865a24eb910214a5cd9c28447e4cd76a.poster.avif?t=1747336092\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/865a24eb910214a5cd9c28447e4cd76a.webm?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/865a24eb910214a5cd9c28447e4cd76a.mp4?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASSIVE BOSS FIGHTS</strong></h2>Legend has it that <strong>Tau</strong> fathered seven sons: the seven <strong>Godfiends</strong>. Defeat them in grandiose boss fights that will require skill and strategy from every player.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/9c519f31cae622e7356493fc02b8aa9b.poster.avif?t=1747336092\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/9c519f31cae622e7356493fc02b8aa9b.webm?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/9c519f31cae622e7356493fc02b8aa9b.mp4?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLD-BUILDING</strong></h2>Rebuild your village, unlock dozens of unique relics and skills and find powerful allies to aid you in your journey.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/2ddb3dfc77b975d7cfc4d555ddd68aaf.poster.avif?t=1747336092\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/2ddb3dfc77b975d7cfc4d555ddd68aaf.webm?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/2ddb3dfc77b975d7cfc4d555ddd68aaf.mp4?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MYSTERIOUS LORE</strong></h2>Why are you the only being capable of resisting curses? What is <strong>Tau's</strong> true intent? Who's waiting for you in the depths of the jungle? Discover a refreshing story inspired by a legend from ancient Native American Folklore.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/9f0b56f12fa4fb57994faa398273fb01.poster.avif?t=1747336092\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/9f0b56f12fa4fb57994faa398273fb01.webm?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/9f0b56f12fa4fb57994faa398273fb01.mp4?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","developers":["Extra Small","Sad Socket"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/header.jpg?t=1747336092","is_free":false